- Remove all references to designing for or executing ELD compliance and driver app modifications from the Phase 1 Approach and Months 1-2 of the Timeline. The Client Matrix explicitly ties touching the driver app and ELD support to Phase 2, so these elements should only be referenced as part of Phase 2 Planning in Month 6.



